  "label": "User projected onto the accusatory meme scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the overall accusatory meme scene, which visually and textually presents Adam Schiff as an 'anti-american democrat' funded by 'america-hating george soros', using the hashtag #treason. This projection implies the user is identifying with or adopting the meme's hateful narrative, which attacks Schiff based on his political identity and alleged financial backers. The scene functions as the primary locus of projection, as it combines the visual of Adam Schiff with the textual accusations to form a unified, dehumanizing portrayal.",
